/T (Then came Mechanical TI with one gargantuan task consuming the entire day - rectifying the seven points issued. The team wasted no time, their focused and persistent effort was on full display as they worked tirelessly to address every detail. Despite rejoining the queue at the very end and the day concluding before their next turn, the immense progress made was a testament to their engineering competency and collective drive to succeed. That made it worthwhile.)
