/T (The team demonstrated remarkable efficiency by immediately clearing all previous technical points within 30 minutes on their second attempt. When a new point was raised concerning compressed gas cylinders exceeding the regulated 10 bar limit, the team acted decisively. Through a quick third attempt, they successfully rerouted the pneumatics and explained various failsafes. We finally cleared it and received that bright, orange Mechanical TI Sticker. )
