/P 187 0 R
/E (The accumulator is the vital energy reservoir of our vehicle. This month marked the successful disassembly of the previous ETV accumulator modules, transitioning toward the new, optimised architecture designed for a max voltage of 252V.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
