430 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 187 0 R
/E (The progress was further strengthened by the assembly of the accumulator mezzanine. This involved the integration of the Accumulator Management System\(AMS\) Master board, Precharge and Tractive system status indicator\(TSSI\) board, Isolation monitoring device \(IMD\), Accumulator Isolation Relays \(AIRs\), and the primary fuse. Harness wiring was done to facilitate connectivity among these critical components inside the accumulator and to facilitate signal and power transmission outside the accumulator, establishing the interface for the vehicle's power distribution and safety systems. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
