/P 188 0 R
/T (The assembly of the new motor controller, designed for a single-motor configuration, began with the manufacturing of the aluminium enclosure and the validation of the liquid-cooled cold plate. This plate was engineered to manage the thermal loads of the IGBTs. Once the enclosure was anodised for surface durability, the IGBTs were installed by mounting them directly within the housing onto the cold plate surface.)
/E (The assembly of the new motor controller, designed for a single-motor configuration, began with the manufacturing of the aluminium enclosure and the validation of the liquid-cooled cold plate. This plate was engineered to manage the thermal loads of the IGBTs. Once the enclosure was anodised for surface durability, the IGBTs were installed by mounting them directly within the housing onto the cold plate surface.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
